--------------------- CableDyn Input File ------------------------------------
CableDyn driver deck -- single steel wire rope catenary mooring (grounded), static IC
-- Spiral-strand steel wire rope: sheathed diam 0.15 m, dry mass 90 kg/m, EA 8.0e8 N (net-heavy).
-- A grounded catenary in 80 m of water: ~310 m chord spanned by 330 m of wire, so a short grounded
-- portion rests on the seabed and the suspended length rises to the fairlead at the surface.
